Title: "Related"
Id: "a8c1f73c-ef4a-4bae-b512-23e8ec97df0c"

Text: "`related:` records one or more open-text related-item notes.

```mlg-fragment
Documented:
. related: \"See also the axiom of pairing.\"
```

The content is prose metadata, not a checked command reference. Use `References:` when linking bibliographic resources."
Id: "7707b0fe-8eb0-4c5c-9eca-89c1549669c2"
